    <string name="more_city_title">Offline city guide</string>
    <string name="more_city_body">Fort and Colaba hold much of Mumbai\u2019s heritage architecture. Marine Drive and the Worli Sea Link are best around sunset. Juhu Beach fills up for street food in the evening. Joggers use Marine Drive early morning and Shivaji Park afternoons.</string>
